      "message": "Thanks, I saw that.\n\nAfter peeling some layers, I got to the point [1] where I think we just need to disable pathops (and pdf, etc depenents) in `Shared` builds: like all other modules, pathops uses private core skia symbols which are not being exported - so we can\u0027t build it in component mode.\n\nDoes that sound reasonable?\n\n[1] https://logs.chromium.org/logs/skia/71bab20317ebd211/+/steps/ninja/0/stdout",
      "parentUuid": "6c7f70d8_018c0af7",
